<title>ITALY: Italian President meets Bank of Italy governor.</title>
<headline>Italian President meets Bank of Italy governor.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro met Bank of Italy governor Antonio Fazio on Wednesday, the president's office said in statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Industrialists, unions and government supporters all called on the central bank to cut its rates last week after data showed inflation falling to 1.7 percent year-on-year in April from 2.2 percent in March. The Bank of Italy has not yet moved.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
